{"name": "Rogue: Genesia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Walk upon a new world and slay foes endangering it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/f09c98a88e0e60d841db77cf9d972155.poster.avif?t=1787021087\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/f09c98a88e0e60d841db77cf9d972155.webm?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/f09c98a88e0e60d841db77cf9d972155.mp4?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fend against vast enemy forces, reaching hundreds of foes on screen at any given time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this action rogue-lite, you play as Rog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/c330cfe00ee78819aa8998fc6140f10b.poster.avif?t=1787021087\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/c330cfe00ee78819aa8998fc6140f10b.webm?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/c330cfe00ee78819aa8998fc6140f10b.mp4?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master of all weapons, Rog can use anything to slay his numerous foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Kill, grow stronger, and kill some more!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"342\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.poster.avif?t=1787021087\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.webm?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.mp4?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make your build from more than 300+ passive upgrades and 50+ weapons.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.poster.avif?t=1787021087\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.webm?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.mp4?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You define Rog's adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose which path Rog takes. Feel brave enough to take on a powerful foe, or would you prefer to rest at the shop? <strong>The choice is yours!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/a6703017648c948c1c4c2efc0d5fef00.poster.avif?t=1787021087\" width=\"690\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/a6703017648c948c1c4c2efc0d5fef00.webm?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/a6703017648c948c1c4c2efc0d5fef00.mp4?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">80+ Powerful Artifacts to discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On this journey, you'll collect many unique and powerful artifacts that will greatly impact your game experience. Harness their power to help you on your quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/cdd5e35446ec3f7b56c31eb16cf89cd3.poster.avif?t=1787021087\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/cdd5e35446ec3f7b56c31eb16cf89cd3.webm?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/cdd5e35446ec3f7b56c31eb16cf89cd3.mp4?t=1787021087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Different avatars with different playstyles!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you prefer guns, swords or having an army of summons kill your enemies for you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/107b2b6a898e5982f65f1c41207e61cc.avif?t=1787021087\" width=\"616\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Walk upon a new world and slay foes endangering it. Rogue : Genesia is an action rogue-lite game, where you fight relentless hordes consisting of hundreds and thousands of monsters, make your build, break the balance, defeat bosses and save one of the many worlds.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/header.jpg?t=1787021087", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Bullet Hell", "Action Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Arcade", "Twin Stick Shooter"], "developers": "Ouadi Huard", "publishers": "Ouadi Huard", "release_date": "Mar 7, 2025", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "2067920", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "7 March 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Q-P_7O81Q8g", "first_seen": 1741302000.0, "review_rank": 1771}